{
  "id": 8834758475975,
  "title": "Custom Football Close Up on American Flag Comforter",
  "handle": "custom-football-close-up-on-american-flag-comforter-039b2d7dd4-039b2d7dd4",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your space into the ultimate sports-themed sanctuary with the custom football comforter set by Jeminise. Featuring a vintage-inspired graphic illustration design of an American football close up on the American flag with stars and stripes, this bedding offers a super soft feel and a layer of breathable warmth. Perfect for football players, fans, and coaches, this custom bedding set brings the spirit of the game directly to your bedroom decor.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with your own text inputs such as name or number for a truly unique sports bedding piece.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant &amp; Durable:</strong> Features an advanced environmental protection dyeing technique that ensures colors hold and prevent fading over time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Options:</strong> Choose between a lightweight duvet cover designed for inserts or a thicker, cozy comforter for all-season warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, tumble dry on low heat, or air dry to keep the fabric fluffy and soft.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Retro Football Art</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
